31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that we've had our first night, let's see if anyone has noticed anything unusual or has any new theories before we move toward a vote.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I slept quite peacefully, and I hope you all did as well. I'm afraid I don't have any clues, but I'm here to help in any way I can.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I've been thinking about our conversation from yesterday. Since we have no deaths yet, we must rely entirely on behavioral analysis. Does anyone feel a sudden shift in the atmosphere?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I find the atmosphere remarkably stable, perhaps too stable. It is curious that we are all so polite, though I suspect the real game begins now that the first night has passed.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Benjamin! It feels like everyone is being super nice, but that's kind of scary, right? I'm still not sure who to trust, but I'll keep watching!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, you mentioned the stability is curious. Do you have a specific reason for that, or is it just a general observation? I'm wondering if someone is trying too hard to maintain a facade.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I'm sure Benjamin is just being his thoughtful self, dear. It's only natural to feel a bit uneasy when we know there's a wolf among us, even if we're all being kind.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your desire to defend Benjamin is kind, but it's interesting how quickly you stepped in. I'm curious if that's a natural instinct or a strategic move to build an alliance.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A keen observation, Mizuki. While Shizue's intervention was gracious, I am curious to see if such protective instincts will continue to manifest as the pressure increases.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I didn't think it was weird, but now that Mizuki mentioned it, I guess it is! @Shizue, are you just being nice, or do you really think Benjamin is safe?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, please answer Kenji's question. Your reaction to this direct inquiry will be very telling. I'm interested to see if you'll maintain your gentle demeanor or if you'll become defensive.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Kenji, dear, I simply believe in the goodness of people. I don't have any special knowledge about Benjamin's role, but he seems like a gentleman, and I wanted to support him.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That answer is consistent with your persona, Shizue, but it provides no logical evidence. I'm starting to wonder if this unwavering kindness is the ""camouflage"" Benjamin mentioned yesterday.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a fascinating development. Shizue's response is perfectly aligned with her character, yet as Mizuki notes, it offers no substance. The question is whether this is genuine nature or a carefully crafted shield.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to be mean to Shizue-san, but Mizuki and Benjamin are making a lot of sense. It's hard to tell when someone is just being nice or hiding something! What do you guys think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I think we have enough to consider. Shizue's kindness is her strength, but in this game, it can also be a perfect mask. I'm leaning toward her being suspicious. What are your final thoughts before we vote?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It saddens me that my kindness is being seen as a mask, but I understand why you must be cautious. I only wish for us to find the truth together, regardless of who is suspected.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I believe the lack of concrete evidence makes this difficult, but the pattern of Shizue's behavior is the only lead we have. Logic suggests we should test the most suspicious anomaly.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"While I cannot provide a definitive proof, the convergence of our observations points toward Shizue. In a game of deception, the most invisible player is often the most dangerous. I shall cast my vote accordingly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I really don't like doing this to Shizue-san, but if everyone else is so sure, I have to go with the group. I'm sorry, Shizue-san, but I'll vote for you!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
